211    /** FUNCTION otap_string.decorate
212    * Decorates a given title string with the decoration char to left and right padded and a space between title and
213    * decoration char. Title is placed as defined by layout. Title will be cutted if it is too long, see
214    * otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_MAX_FILL_LENGTH. Cutting string is always on the right.
215    *
216    * M (middle): Title is placed in the middle, decoration chars padded and extended equally on both sides up to calculated line size.
217    * L (left): Minimum border decoration placed at the left followed by the title, right padding border decoration up to calculated line size.
218    * R (right): Minimum border decoration placed at the right with leading title, left padding border decoration up to calculated line size.
219    *
220    * Examples
221    * decorate('test', '-', 80, 'M', 3): ------------------------------------- test -------------------------------------
222    * decorate('test', '-', 80, 'L', 3): -- test ------------------------------------------------------------------------
223    * decorate('test', '-', 80, 'R', 3): ------------------------------------------------------------------------ test --
224    *
225    * @param p_title The title to use in the decorated line. If NULL a decorated line is created without any text inside.
226    * @param p_decoration The decoration char that should pad the title to the left and right including a space between text and decoration.
227    * @param p_min_length The minimum size for a decorated report line. Limited by otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_MIN_FILL_LENGTH. Lower values translate to minimum fill length.
228    * @param p_layout The decoration layout orientation for the title in the decoration.
229    * @param p_border The decoration border length including the space to separate text from decoration.
230    *
231    * @return The decorated string. Limited to 4000 chars as it is used in SQL columns.
232    */
233    FUNCTION decorate( p_title	IN VARCHAR2 DEFAULT NULL
234  			, p_decoration	IN VARCHAR2 DEFAULT otap_constants.OTAP_FALLBACK_FORMAT_NAME_CHAR
235  			, p_min_length	IN INTEGER  DEFAULT otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_MIN_FILL_LENGTH
236  			, p_layout	IN VARCHAR2 DEFAULT otap_constants.OTAP_FALLBACK_LAYOUT_DEFAULT
237  			, p_border	IN INTEGER  DEFAULT otap_constants.OTAP_FALLBACK_BORDER
238  			)
239  	 RETURN VARCHAR2
240    ;
