366    * @param p_cfg_template The config name of the template. See otap_util.CFG_ constants.
367    * @param p_type_label The label name of the @type@ variable, if needed. See otap_util.CFG_LABEL constants.
368    * @param p_param1 The 1st variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
369    * @param p_param1_value The substitution value for the 1st variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
370    * @param p_param2 The 2nd variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
371    * @param p_param2_value The substitution value for the 2nd variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
