 96    /** FUNCTION otap_test.finish_test
 97    * Resets the OTAP_SESSION object. Will set a new session id, reset the counters and the names
 98    * for test set, group and name. When a test session is finished, the test session view will not
 99    * longer show the tests from the old session. If intended count is set, a test record about
100    * executed and expected tests is written. Wrapper for otap_api.finish_test.
101    *
102    * @param p_write_count_rec The indicator, if record count test should be done and written. Either otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_TRUE or otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_FALSE. Setting has no effect if intented count is not set or 0.
103    *
104    * @return A summary of the old session and details of the new session as text message LF delimited.
105    *
106    * @exception -20099 Internal error, invalid OTAP_SESSION object.
107    */
108    FUNCTION finish_test(p_write_count_rec IN NUMBER DEFAULT otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_TRUE)
109  	 RETURN VARCHAR2
