930    /** FUNCTION otap_test.test_error
931    * Provides a possibility to report script errors to test sessions, that are not discovered by tests itself.
932    * Usually using SPERRORLOG and an error identifier during script runs or in exception blocks. Test errors
933    * are always considered as UNDEFINED as tests have not been executed as intended. Does not execute any test
934    * only writes an test error record.
