1027  	* @param p_show_header Used to surpress header comments, init, count and finish section. Default 1 will contain all sections, otherwise skipped.
1028  	* @param p_excl_sysgen Used to ignore system generated objects identified by SYS_, # or $. Default 1 will ignore system generated objects, otherwise included.
