SQL> -- @status@ represents TEXT_SUMMARY_ERROR or TEXT_SUMMARY_SUCCESS
SQL> -- @runtime@ represents the complete runtime as Oracle interval
SQL> -- @exectime@ represents the test execution time (without setup and call overheads) as Oracle interval
SQL> -- @runs@ represent the amount of tests executed for the set, group or test name
SQL> -- @errors@ represent the amount of tests with errors for the set, group or test name
SQL> -- @issues@ represent the amount of test setup or internal errors for the set, group or test name
